    {
      "id": "part-10",
      "title": {
        "en": "Part 10"
      },
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "prose",
          "body": {
            "en": "Salamander: 1 AP Draw 4 with 2 exhaust is amazing\nKefox: Tutoring out a card and giving it retrieve is amazing\nDominion: Pretty slow to scale\nGrave: 60% Crit rate is nice, then it just self deletes, not bad but wouldn't dupe\nNegotiate: 2 Moral for 1, it's not great, but it's accessible"
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "card-list",
          "items": [
            {
              "cardId": "c_1004_uni4",
              "note": {
                "en": ""
              },
              "rating": "5/5"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "prose",
          "body": {
            "en": "Finisher: This is so butt without E2, and even for a final build it isnt that great a draw\nQuick Shelling/Leap Attack: Cantrips that do damage, really good\nPrecision Aim: Can top Target 4 to redraw it, or other Attunement effects\nAmbush: If you can break ig, not especially good"
          }
        },
