        },
        {
          "type": "prose",
          "body": {
            "en": "Rapid 1: Giga combo, best damage, most bullets, especially with -1 cost Divine, but only first time\nRapid 2: 3x hit = 3x bullets, most consistent option\nRapid 3: Single big hit? weird\nRapid 4: Makes it into a Bullet? interesting?\nRapid 5: Gives Luke Utility as a type of draw support, -1 cost divine is very good"
          }
        },
