        {
          "type": "prose",
          "body": {
            "en": "Seize 1: The highest Multi hit bullet is Rapid 4 and that's only 3, super mid\nSeize 2: 480% only on bullets is not that fire\nSeize 3: You just need 7 bullets to beat Seize 2\nSeize 4: If used on Demon Dance, the damage is insane\nSeize 5: Upgrade = Exhaust = Most consistent, always valuable"
