            "en": "Stealth 1: Crit chance on bullets ain't bad\nStealth 2: Is okay\nStealth 3: 4 bullets, also can set up if this turn isnt combo turn\nStealth 4: 0 cost upgrade, can get draw divine easy, and free turn based bullet gen\nStealth 5: 2 AP is expensive, but it is alot of bullets and exhaustable ig"
